18:48.550 --> 18:50.110
Burung mekanik membawaku ke sana.

18:53.190 --> 18:53.990
Pegang erat.

19:18.590 --> 19:20.230
Ayo, minum sedikit air.

19:20.750 --> 19:21.550
Terima kasih.

19:35.090 --> 19:36.240
Ini, ambillah.

